    "directions": [
      "In a parat, add paneer slices, sprinkle some salt to taste, degi red chili powder, cumin powder, coriander powder and marinate it well from both the sides.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, add marinated paneer and shallow fry it for a while until golden brown.",
      "Transfer it to an absorbent sheet and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add oil, remaining oil, once it's hot, add onion and saute it for a minute until translucent.",
      "Add ginger, green chilies and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add carrot and cook it well for a while.",
      "Add tender coriander stems, potatoes, coriander leaves and mix it well.",
      "Add prepared masala fried paneer, bread slices, salt to taste, black pepper powder, give it a good mix and cook it for 2-3 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep it aside to cool down at room temperature.",
      "Take a lemon size ball and give it a desired shape.",
      "Dip the prepared balls in cornstarch slurry and coat it well with bread crumbs.",
      "Transfer it to a hot and shallow fry it until golden brown.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with coriander sprig and lemon wedges.",
      "Serve hot with prepared tadka ketchup dip.",
      "In a pan, once it's hot, add mustard oil and splutter it well.",
      "Add curry leaves, green chillies, a pinch of chili flakes and cook it for a minute.",
      "Add tomato ketchup, water and simmer it for 4-5 minutes until it thickens.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl and serve with a prepared paneer cutlet."
    ],
